          "texts_in_order": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Carpio Media provides cinematic drone production for television, documentaries, commercials, branded films, features, episodic projects, and live broadcast support. Based in Forest Hills, Queens, we work with producers, directors, cinematographers, agencies, location teams, and production companies throughout New York City and the Tri State Area."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Coverage can include establishing shots, location reveals, tracking shots, transitions, moving subject coverage, cityscapes, landscapes, and controlled aerial sequences designed to support the story and visual language of the production."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Production planning considers the shot list, airspace, location restrictions, permits, weather, sun position, crew movement, talent, vehicles, communication, camera requirements, and safe operating areas. Carpio Media can coordinate with the production team so each aerial setup fits the schedule and the needs of the scene."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "To request availability, send the production type, location, shoot date, call time, shot list or storyboard, camera and delivery requirements, crew contacts, permit status, and any location restrictions through the Contact page."
            }
          ],
